# SeRuh — deep links
#
# Only these patterns are rewritten to the app. Everything else keeps
# returning 404 on purpose: a catch-all 200 turns every typo into a
# soft 404 that search engines then have to judge.
#
# Hash routes (#/admin, #/me) are untouched — a fragment never
# reaches the server, so nothing here can capture them.

/q/*        /index.html   200
/f/*        /index.html   200
/mood/*     /index.html   200
/c/*        /index.html   200
/daily      /index.html   200
